msgstr "Microsoft Entra ID and Microsoft Graph"

msgid "SharePoint, OneDrive and Teams rights"
msgstr "SharePoint, OneDrive and Teams rights"

msgid "The same application reads the MFA methods of the accounts and the sharing rights of SharePoint, OneDrive and Teams, when you click the button on these pages. Nothing is ever written in Entra ID or Microsoft 365 and nothing runs automatically."
msgstr "The same application reads the MFA methods of the accounts and the sharing rights of SharePoint, OneDrive and Teams, when you click the button on these pages. Nothing is ever written in Entra ID or Microsoft 365 and nothing runs automatically."

msgid "For the sharing rights, also grant Sites.Read.All, Files.Read.All, User.Read.All and GroupMember.Read.All."
msgstr "For the sharing rights, also grant Sites.Read.All, Files.Read.All, User.Read.All and GroupMember.Read.All."

msgid "The tenant, the application ID and the client secret are entered in the plugin configuration, Connectors tab."
msgstr "The tenant, the application ID and the client secret are entered in the plugin configuration, Connectors tab."

msgid "The GitHub and GitLab tokens are entered in the plugin configuration, Connectors tab."
msgstr "The GitHub and GitLab tokens are entered in the plugin configuration, Connectors tab."

msgid "Microsoft Graph is not set up yet. Enter the tenant, the application ID and the client secret in the plugin configuration (Connectors tab), or import a CSV export below."
msgstr "Microsoft Graph is not set up yet. Enter the tenant, the application ID and the client secret in the plugin configuration (Connectors tab), or import a CSV export below."

msgid "Nothing has been read yet. 1. Enter the code repository of each application in its \"Secure development\" tab. 2. Enter a read-only token in the plugin configuration, Connectors tab. 3. Click \"Read now\"."
msgstr "Nothing has been read yet. 1. Enter the code repository of each application in its \"Secure development\" tab. 2. Enter a read-only token in the plugin configuration, Connectors tab. 3. Click \"Read now\"."
